WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.374 --> 00:00:10.510 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; GOOD MORNING, HONEY.
I'M SORRY.

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:17.684 align:start size:94% position:6%
I DIDN'T MAKE YOU BREAKFAST.
BUT OUR SON DID.

00:00:17.684 --> 00:00:21.021 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; HAPPY MOTHER'S DAY, MOMMY.
&gt;&gt; OH, HONEY!

00:00:21.021 --> 00:00:24.858 align:start size:94% position:6%
THIS IS SO GREAT!
ARE YOU THE SWEETEST.

00:00:24.858 --> 00:00:28.728
THANK YOU, SWEETHEART.
&gt;&gt; I HELPED A LITTLE BIT ON THE

00:00:28.728 --> 00:00:35.602 align:start size:94% position:6%
EGGS, BUT HE DID THE TOAST ALL
BY HIMSELF.

00:00:35.602 --> 00:00:36.736 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; WELL, MMM.
THIS IS THE BEST TOAST I HAVE

00:00:36.736 --> 00:00:37.504 align:start size:94% position:6%
EVER HAD.
&gt;&gt; REALLY?

00:00:37.504 --> 00:00:40.507 align:start size:94% position:6%
YES!
&gt;&gt; REALLY.

00:00:40.507 --> 00:00:45.011
I AM SO LUCKY TO BE YOUR MOMMY.
THE DAY YOU WERE BORN WAS THE

00:00:45.011 --> 00:00:48.448 size:75% position:38%
BEST DAY OF MY LIFE.
&gt;&gt; WHAT WAS IT LIKE?

00:00:48.448 --> 00:00:55.655 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; THE DAY YOU WERE BORN?
IT WAS AMAZING.

00:00:55.655 --> 00:01:03.129 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; ONLY A FEW MORE CENTIMETERS
AND YOU'LL BE READY.

00:01:03.129 --> 00:01:04.164
&gt;&gt; HOW MUCH BIGGER CAN THE HOLE
GET?

00:01:04.164 --> 00:01:06.099 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; JUST BREATHE.
&gt;&gt; IT HURTS!

00:01:06.099 --> 00:01:09.202 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; WERE YOU SCARED, MOMMY?
&gt;&gt; OH, NO.

00:01:09.202 --> 00:01:12.338
I WAS EXCITED.
I HAD A BIG SMILE ON MY FACE THE

00:01:12.338 --> 00:01:15.408 align:start size:94% position:6%
WHOLE TIME.
DIDN'T I?

00:01:15.408 --> 00:01:18.578 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; OH, YEAH.
&gt;&gt; WE HAVE TO PERFORM AN

00:01:18.578 --> 00:01:26.086 align:start size:94% position:6%
EPISIOTOMY.
&gt;&gt; NO, DON'T!

00:01:26.086 --> 00:01:27.620 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; WHY DOES IT LOOK LIKE THAT.
&gt;&gt; WERE YOU SCARED?

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:36.763 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; DADDIES DON'T GET SCARED.
&gt;&gt; I'M NOT READY!

00:01:36.763 --> 00:01:46.506 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; THE NICE DOCTOR CAME IN AND
TOLD US IT WAS TIME.

00:01:46.506 --> 00:01:48.241 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; WHERE HAVE YOU BEEN?
&gt;&gt; SHE TOLD ME TO GIVE ONE

00:01:48.241 --> 00:01:49.776 align:start size:94% position:6%
LITTLE PUSH.
&gt;&gt; HE'S CROWNING.

00:01:49.776 --> 00:01:57.584 align:start size:94% position:6%
ONE MORE PUSH!
&gt;&gt; AM I POOPING?

00:01:57.584 --> 00:02:00.053 align:start size:94% position:6%
AM I POOPING?
&gt;&gt; NO, BABY, NO.

00:02:00.053 --> 00:02:02.188 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; WITH ONE LITTLE PUSH, YOU
WERE BORN.

00:02:02.188 --> 00:02:07.160
YOU WERE THE MOST BEAUTIFUL BABY
IN THE WHOLE WORLD.

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:12.465 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; WHY DOES HE LOOK LIKE THAT.
WHY IS HE YELLOW?

00:02:12.465 --> 00:02:14.267 align:start size:94% position:6%
IS THAT NORMAL?
&gt;&gt; WHY IS HE SO UGLY?

00:02:14.267 --> 00:02:17.470 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; THAT'S WHAT HAPPENED ON THE
BEST DAY OF MY LIFE.

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:27.714 align:start size:94% position:6%
YOU KNOW WHAT ELSE?
EVERY DAY SINCE THEN HAS BEEN

00:02:27.714 --> 00:02:32.285
BETTER THAN THE DAY BEFORE.
&gt;&gt; WHERE ARE IS MY HOCKEY STUFF?

00:02:32.285 --> 00:02:40.894 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; IN THE HALL CLOSET.
I MIGHT GET A DRINK AFTER.

00:02:40.894 --> 00:02:44.797 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; I LOVE YOU, MOMMY.
&gt;&gt; OH, I LOVE YOU TOO, HONEY.

00:02:44.797 --> 00:02:47.867 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; MOMMY?
&gt;&gt; YEAH?

00:02:47.867 --> 00:02:52.539
&gt;&gt; I HAD AN ACCIDENT LAST NIGHT.
&gt;&gt; I'M SURE DADDY CLEANED IT UP.

00:02:52.539 --> 00:03:00.513
&gt;&gt; NO, I WANTED YOU TO CLEAN IT.

